Sun Nov 08 02:00:00 UTC 2026 - ahjolinna <ahjolinna@yahoo.com>

- Ship /usr/etc/zypp/zypp.conf.d/atropos-dup.conf, which sets
  solver.dupAllowVendorChange = true. AtropOS packages and openSUSE
  packages have different vendors, so dup stopped at a solver question
  whenever one vendor's package obsoleted the other's, and Discover and
  transactional-update cancelled the update. In the other direction
  dup silently kept the old package. Repository priority still decides
  which package wins.
- Release 7.

